<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview ups Sierra.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview ups Sierra.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial analyst Scott Randall said he raised his short-term rating on Sierra Semiconductor Corp to buy from hold, but left his long-term rating unchanged at hold.</p>
<p>--- The analyst said he maintained his earnings projections of $0.80 per share for 1996 and $0.76 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street Bureau 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
